 pruning, expectimax search and the modeling of uncertainty. After that, we focus primarily on machine learning, starting with methods for reasoning under uncertainty. We cover learning of decision trees from examples, reinforcement learning in Markov Decision Processes, perceptron learning, and deep learning. We touch briefly on the future of AI.     The teaching methodology combines lectures, in-class and out-of-class exercises, and programming assignments.","topics":[],"score":227988,"global_rank":147011},{"name":"saivatsavai/Todo-List","owner":"saivatsavai","html_url":"https://github.com/saivatsavai/Todo-List","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Simple todo list connected with the Firebase written in flask","topics":[],"score":227978,"global_rank":147033},{"name":"evandanderson/wordle","owner":"evandanderson","html_url":"https://github.com/evandanderson/wordle","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Command line wordle built in Python","topics":[],"score":227978,"global_rank":147035},{"name":"zliwow/DistilBERT-based-sentiment-analysis-model","owner":"zliwow","html_url":"https://github.com/zliwow/DistilBERT-based-sentiment-analysis-model","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227977,"global_rank":147055},{"name":"emontalvo610/therapy_backend","owner":"emontalvo610","html_url":"https://github.com/emontalvo610/therapy_backend","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227977,"global_rank":147058},{"name":"kevinslin/simplecache","owner":"kevinslin","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinslin/simplecache","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Persistent caching even after program termination","topics":[],"score":227974,"global_rank":147071},{"name":"colobas/obras","owner":"colobas","html_url":"https://github.com/colobas/obra